---`POST /memberships/{id}/pause`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, Conflict.
---@param input whop.memberships.PauseMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.Membership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:pause_membership(input) end

---Reactivate Membership
---
---Restores access to a `canceled` or `expired` membership that contains only one-time purchases and sets its `status` to `completed`. Lifetime memberships regain lifetime access. For memberships with an expiration, `days` sets `current_period_end` that many days from now; without it the original `current_period_end` is kept, so `days` is required once that has passed. Active and recurring memberships cannot be reactivated.
---
---`POST /memberships/{id}/reactivate`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input whop.memberships.ReactivateMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.Membership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:reactivate_membership(input) end

---Resume Membership
---
---Resumes a previously paused membership's recurring payment collection. Billing resumes on the next cycle.
---
---`POST /memberships/{id}/resume`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, Conflict.
---@param input whop.memberships.ResumeMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.Membership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:resume_membership(input) end

---Resync Membership Access
---
---Re-runs access fulfillment for a membership: recomputes the member's content access on Whop, re-validates their Discord link (re-adding them to the server and re-assigning roles if needed), and re-fulfills TradingView indicator access. Telegram access is invite-based and is not resynced. The work runs in the background and the outcome is written to the membership's logs.
---
---`POST /memberships/{id}/resync_access`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, Conflict.
---@param input whop.memberships.ResyncAccessMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.Membership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:resync_access_membership(input) end

---Transfer Membership
---
---Creates a one-use transfer URL for a membership. Opening the URL while logged into a different Whop account claims the membership onto that account. The membership's buyer can generate a link for their own membership with `membership:transfer` when the product allows transfers and the membership is `trialing`, `active`, or `completed`. An account credential with `membership:update` bypasses both restrictions.
---
---`POST /memberships/{id}/transfer`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, Conflict.
---@param input whop.memberships.TransferMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.TransferMembershipResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:transfer_membership(input) end

---Uncancel membership
---
---[Legacy API — https://docs.whop.com/api-reference]
---
---Reverse a pending cancellation for a membership that was scheduled to cancel at period end.
---
---Required permissions:
--- - `member:manage`
--- - `member:email:read`
--- - `member:basic:read`
---
---`POST /memberships/{id}/uncancel`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound, UnprocessableEntity.
---@param input whop.memberships.UncancelMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.LegacyMembership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:uncancel_membership(input) end

---Update Membership
---
---Updates a membership: merge metadata key-value pairs, toggle `cancel_at_period_end` — `true` schedules the cancellation for the end of the current billing period, `false` reverses a pending one — or move future renewals to another of the customer's saved payment methods with `payment_method_id`.
---
---`PATCH /memberships/{id}`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden.
---@param input whop.memberships.UpdateMembershipRequest
---@return whop.memberships.Membership? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_membership(input) end

return Module
